              "maxLength": 190000,
              "description": "The body of SKILL.md, in Markdown: the instructions a model follows when it uses the skill. No frontmatter; the name and description are added."
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 200,
              "description": "A short name people will pick it by."
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "description",
            "instructions",
            "name"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "description": "Create a skill: reusable instructions (SKILL.md) a model follows for a kind of task, with optional small text files. It's saved as a draft in the person's own library; publish it with publish_skill to use it in chats. Use it when the person asks to make a skill, or to keep a way of working for later."
